  "description": {
    "en": "Coastal motorway connecting Bulgaria's Black Sea cities Varna and Burgas, spanning approximately 103 km. Part of Pan-European Corridor VIII. As of 2016, only 10 km (Varna to Priseltsi) was completed; the remaining 93 km remains in the planned phase. Estimated total cost: €307 million."
